<tr>
    <td  bgcolor="#c0c0c0" valign="TOP"><table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5" border="0">
<tr>
    <td  bgcolor="#c0c0c0" width="100%" valign="top"><tt><font color="#000000">
Author:&nbsp;<a href="/showmember.php?name=Wolas">Wolas</a>&nbsp;(---.076.popsite.net)<br>
Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;03-01-01 23:54<br>
<br><HTML>Najena is a simple dungeon to take this hunt is open to all players 15 to 30 <br>
<br>
<br>
the fallowing loot is droped in this dungeon :<br>
Magicians:<br>
Damask armor pieces (common)<br>
Soft Leather Boots (common)<br>
<br>
Side note: Most damask items come from Najena's room<br>
<br>
Terror Tentacles:<br>
Tentacle whip (rare)<br>
Terror Spines (rare)<br>
<br>
Side Note: We can fly :o)<br>
<br>
Ogre Guard:<br>
Guards Key ring (un common)<br>
<br>
Injured Halfling:<br>
Nothing<br>
<br>
Side note: Will jump in to help any of the mages or moosh who are running away from you. I always zone than to kill him, you get a really bad faction hit because of this little guy.<br>
<br>
Erakson (monk) (don't know correct spelling please fix):<br>
Darken sapphire (rare) (un common spawn)<br>
<br>
Side note: Spawns in the outer rathyl room in one of the magician's spots.<br>
<br>
Rathyl:<br>
Bloodstain key (common)<br>
Dry dull Bone Key (common)<br>
Traveller's Pouch (4 slots) (common)<br>
Traveller's Backpack (8 slots) (rare)<br>
<br>
Side note: Has a Magician place holder and both Traveller pack look the same so check the name of pack before you leave it on him.<br>
<br>
Rathyl Reincarnate:<br>
Hollowed Bone bracer (un common/rare)<br>
<br>
Side note: Appears right after you kill rathyl so be ready for an extra fight and is undead.<br>
<br>
Bonecracker:<br>
Dull Bone Key (every time)<br>
Ring of Flesh (rare)<br>
Leering Mask (rare)<br>
Leather Barbed Whip (rare)<br>
<br>
Side Note: Frogiee<br>
<br>
Ogre guard Caption:<br>
Shiny metal key (common)<br>
Large Bronze armor pieces (un common)<br>
War maul (rare)<br>
<br>
Side note: He likes to run for help so root/ensnare and he is tough. <br>
<br>
Visiting Priestess:<br>
??????<br>
<br>
Side note: spawns to right of caption and can heal 50% of her HPs back per spell. She grants a quest to evil characters.(Rare spawn)<br>
<br>
Drelzna:<br>
Disease deflection earring (common)<br>
Blood stain key (every time)<br>
Golden Crescent key (every time)<br>
Jboot Note (un common)<br>
Stilleto of the Blood claw (rare)<br>
Ashenwood spear (rare)<br>
<br>
Side note: Can harms touch you many times so becareful<br>
<br>
Najena:<br>
Golden crescent key (every time)<br>
Flowing Black Robe (common)<br>
Blood knuckle ring (rare)<br>
Black tome w/silver runes (rare)<br>
<br>
Side note: You will always get FBR or a tome. If there is a tome then no FBR. It is always one or the other. <br>
<br>
Undead Knight:<br>
Nothing<br>
<br>
Side note: killed him a few times for fun and never had anything. Won't attack you unless you attack him first. No faction hit when killed. Shadow knight quest NPC.<br>
<br>
Trazdon:<br>
Dark Circuit (un common)<br>
<br>
Side Note: Spawns about 40% of the time and the 2nd mage on stairs is the placeholder. <br>
<br>
Liana Parlone (sp?):<br>
Unknown<br>
<br>
Side note: She has a pet and has a bad habit of charming player all over the zone when she is attacked or when she sees a KOS. Part of a pure caster quest so don't attack/kill her if you want to do the quest. <br>
<br>
Moosh:<br>
Crap (every time)<br>
<br>
Side Note: Will jump if you're in drezl's room, if you are sitting in the little hallway or firghting in it. Just a pain in the but while camping. <br>
<br>
We will try to take down wido misstress who has a dagger with ok stats but with 5 charges of haste it will be great practice for further higher lvl raid, wido misstrs is lvl 40 and has all spells that a necro dose up to that lvl she is very hard to bring down but rewarding when she falls <br>
<br>
i myself will most likley not be able to attend the raid with wolas butwill try to get a high lvl avitar to guide and maybe do some of the pulling, but mostlikly i will be at the zone constantly asking who is it going. <br>
<br>
as a final note i leave all the keys that open all the doors <br>
_________________________<br>
Keys and what they open:<br>
<br>
Shiny Metal key:<br>
Rathyl room outside door<br>
<br>
Dull dry bone key:<br>
Rathyl room inner door<br>
<br>
Bloodstain key:<br>
Drelzna's Room<br>
<br>
Golden Crescent key:<br>
Najena's room<br>
<br>
Guards key ring:<br>
Cells near rathyl room (when you fall down the pit traps)<br>
_______________________<br>
 <br>
I am open to a date just suggest it and we will try to work it out <br>
<br>
___________________________________________<br>
 as for lower lvlv raids im thinking and easy trip to befallen and then maybe hiting Sol a later for some quests and some cool loot :)<br>
<br>
see you all on <br>
<br>
Wolas</HTML></font></tt><p>
